  "id": 922,
  "description": "## 🇦🇺All Australians Welcome! 🇦🇺\n\n### Core Guild Values\n\n- **Self-Enablement:** Everyone is eligible for the Deputy role from consistent contributions.\n  - You have a right to use the benefits of the guild from our shared efforts. \n  - You are also entrusted with activities such as recruitment &amp; promotions.\n- **Welcoming:** We want a range of combat levels to join our guild as low level resource contributions are always appreciated. We expect you will grow with the guild and receive support whenever possible.\n  - If you choose to leave, you will always be welcomed back and at the same rank you were before.\n- **No Discord:** This is a Semi-Casual guild with no plans to go competitive. After all, this is a casual game for a majority of us and there are too many guilds with discord requirements.\n\n\\______________________________________________\n\n**🥅 Current Goals (Updated 02/09/2026)** \n- Contribute to stockpile\n- Repair Teleport Beacon as a primary focus\n\n**📢 Announcement (Updated 02/09/2026)**\n- Season 12 starts soon. More details to follow this weekend.\n\n\\______________________________________________\n### Important Schedules\n\n**🕙 Raids Schedule (Subject To Supply)**\n- At this stage Deputies are free to schedule raids at times that suit them. We have a ridiculous amount of Marks to use up.\n\n**⚔️ Assault Schedule**\n- Stay tuned for further details with Guild Season 12 starting this week.\n\n**🏊 Energising Pool**\n- Every Saturday Afternoon in September\n\n\\______________________________________________\n\n### Hierarchy Progression\n\n**👑 Guild Leader Succession**\n\nIf a guild leader stops playing for a prolonged period, leadership will pass on to the most capable and willing deputy to continue our legacy.\n\n1. FabAsianZung (03/06/2025 - 31/08/2026)\n2. Drafiks (01/09/2026 - Current)\n3. N/A\n\n**🤴Promotion To Deputy**\n1. Consistent ingame activity. \n2. Consistent Guild Contributions, within 2 weeks of earning Officer rank. \n\n**👮‍♂️Promotion To Officer**\n1. Deputies are free to decide.\n2. Consistent Guild Contributions, within 2 weeks of earning Soldier rank. \n\n**🪖Promotion To Soldier**\n1. Deputies are free to decide, within 1 week of joining.\n2. Make an effort for guild contributions shortly after joining.\n\n**📃Accepting Recruit Applications**\n1. Combat level 30 or total level 500\n\n\\______________________________________________\n### Miscellaneous Extras\n\n- Alts are welcome in the guild however it may be kicked to make space for a new Main, based on lowest activity &amp; contributions.\n- We run by **AEST** (GMT+10) 🌏\n- Try to be active (**&gt;10 days** = kick) \n- If kicked for inactivity, feel free to come back when you are ready \n- New Zealanders are also welcome 🇳🇿\n\n**🚩Guild Founded: 3rd of June 2025 by FabAsianZung🚩**",
